   8:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcparam.c ****  *
   9:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcparam.c ****  * This file contains optional default-setting code for the JPEG compressor.
  10:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcparam.c ****  * Applications do not have to use this file, but those that don't use it
  11:Middlewares/Third_Party/LibJPEG/source/jcparam.c ****  * must know a lot more about the innards of the JPEG code.
